{"trace_id": "c4044348-85c1-47c7-bd6e-b8899e3e4f2b", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-003", "text": "给PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:37:12.666Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:37:21.402Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:37:12.666Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:37:14.722Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:37:14.722Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:37:21.402Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:37:21.402Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:37:21.402Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5947000008745817, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "disable_alarm", "delete_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_pt101_high", "tag": "PT101", "high_limit": 2.0, "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_pt101_high"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_pt101_high": {"id": "alarm_pt101_high", "tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 2.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "medium", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.666300000375486, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_pt101_high"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT101"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.005800000508315861, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:319b464b61f3f0217ffb661b1a3779b04671b53dcdfea9a2e7b7281c52fa2ec2", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 977, "output_tokens": 164, "latency_ms": 2054.78199999925, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查看一下现有的 SCADA 点位信息，确认 PT101 是否存在以及它的类型。", "reasoning": "用户想给一个叫\"PT101\"的点位配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段包括 CONFIG_ALARM。\n\n但首先，我需要先查一下现有的点位情况，看看有没有PT101这个点位。目前可用的工具是 manage_points（actions: list_points）和 manage_pages（actions: list_pages）。\n\n让我先查询一下点位列表，看看PT101是否存在。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2083, "output_tokens": 324, "latency_ms": 3456.655199999659, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "查到了！**PT101** 是一个模拟量（analog）点位，适合创建模拟量报警。现在我来为它创建高限报警，阈值设为 2.0，优先级为中等。", "reasoning": "PT101是一个模拟量（analog）点位，适合创建模拟量报警。用户要求配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级。\n\n现在我可以使用 manage_alarms 的 create_analog_alarm 动作来创建这个报警。\n\n参数：\n- action: \"create_analog_alarm\"\n- id: 需要一个唯一的报警ID，比如 \"alarm_pt101_high\"\n- tag: \"PT101\"\n- high_limit: 2.0\n- low_limit: 不需要，设为 null 或不传\n- deadband: 用户没提，使用默认值 0.0\n- priority: \"medium\"\n\n先确认一下用户没有指定deadband，我用默认值0。高限是2.0。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 3666, "output_tokens": 254, "latency_ms": 3214.4208999998227, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已成功为 **PT101** 配置高限报警！以下是配置详情：\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **报警 ID** | `alarm_pt101_high` |\n| **点位 Tag** | PT101 |\n| **报警类型** | 模拟量高限报警 |\n| **高限阈值** | **2.0** |\n| **优先级** | **中等 (medium)** |\n| **死区** | 0.0（默认） |\n\n配置已生效。如果还需要添加低限报警、配置通知规则或进行其他操作，请随时告诉我！\n\n**next_state: DONE**", "reasoning": "报警创建成功了。不过当前阶段仍然是 CONFIG_ALARM，用户可能还有别的需求要做。\n\n用户只说了\"给PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级\"，这个任务已经完成了。让我检查一下是否需要切换到其他阶段或者完成DONE。\n\n当前是CONFIG_ALARM阶段，可切换的下一阶段有：BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n用户没有提出其他需求，所以我可以结束任务了。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6726, "output_tokens": 742, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 8736.823799999911}, "judge": null}
