位和历史记录，无法查询冷凝器出口的历史趋势。建议用户先配置点位，然后配置历史记录。\n\n但我当前阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，只能查询历史记录。要配置点位，可能需要切换到其他阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE\n\n这些阶段看起来也不太适合配置点位... 等等，也许我应该先向用户说明情况，看看用户想怎么做。\n\n或者用户可能只是问一下能不能查，我如实告知目前系统没有配置任何点位和历史数据。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2210, "output_tokens": 781, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 11620.672499999273}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "1a67e3c6-e8d4-4f01-82a9-8d3d656cdcab", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-013", "text": "建两个页面，一个叫报警汇总，一个叫报表，都用黑底，顺便把报表页大小设成4K", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:38:57.082Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:06.185Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:38:57.082Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:01.712Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:01.712Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:01.712Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:01.712Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:03.933Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:03.933Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:06.184Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6654999997408595, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["disable_alarm", "enable_alarm", "delete_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5389999987528427, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.003600000127335079, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 363, "latency_ms": 4626.901100000396, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来处理这个需求。当前阶段只能查询页面，我先切换到页面管理阶段。\n\n**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**\n\n让我先查看一下当前已有的页面情况。", "reasoning": "用户想要：\n1. 创建两个页面：一个叫\"报警汇总\"（Alarm Summary），一个叫\"报表\"（Report）\n2. 都用黑底（黑色背景）\n3. 报表页大小设成4K\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用的工具有 manage_pages 和 manage_points。但 manage_pages 当前只允许 list_pages 动作，没有创建页面的动作。\n\n让我看看当前阶段和可用工具。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具有：\n- manage_pages: 只允许 list_pages\n- manage_points: 只允许 list_points\n\n这些工具都不支持创建页面或设置页面属性。所以我需要切换到其他阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n其中 MANAGE_PAGES 听起来适合用来管理页面。我需要切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。\n\n但让我先看看 manage_pages 的当前 actions 只有 list_pages，也许切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段后，manage_pages 工具会有更多的 actions 可用。\n\n我先切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段看看。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2259, "output_tokens": 192, "latency_ms": 2216.2887999984378, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "当前处于 **CONFIG_ALARM** 阶段，但创建页面需要切换到页面管理阶段，让我切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES**。\n\n**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**", "reasoning": "我当前处于 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，但用户的需求是创建页面（报警汇总和报表），而不是配置报警。CONFIG_ALARM 阶段的可用工具只有 manage_alarms 和 manage_points，无法创建页面。\n\n我需要切换到合适的阶段。可切换的下一阶段有：BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n显然 MANAGE_PAGES 是最合适的阶段来创建和管理页面。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 3537, "output_tokens": 63, "latency_ms": 2247.2553999996308, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "系统似乎还没有切换到正确的阶段，让我再次请求切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段。\n\n**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**", "reasoning": "看起来系统又把我拉回到了 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段。但我需要创建页面，这需要 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。让我再次尝试切换。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6784, "output_tokens": 618, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9101.759200000743}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "9691229a-dc58-43b4-96b8-a08095da77a6", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-013", "text": "建两个页面，一个叫报警汇总，一个叫报表，都用黑底，顺便把报表页大小设成4K", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:38:56.464Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:28.159Z", "total_turns": 6, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:38:56.464Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:00.312Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:00.312Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:02.648Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:02.648Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:09.115Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:09.115Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:14.348Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:14.348Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:22.620Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:22.620Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:28.159Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6345000001601875, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 307, "latency_ms": 3846.141099998931, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查一下当前已经有哪些页面。", "reasoning": "用户想要做两件事：\n1. 创建两个页面：报警汇总 和 报表\n2. 设置报表页大小为4K\n\n但看看当前的阶段和可用工具：\n- 当前阶段：ANALYZE_INTENT\n- 可用工具：manage_pages（允许actions: list_pages）、manage_points（允许actions: list_points）\n\n这些工具只允许 list_pages 和 list_points，没有创建页面或修改页面属性的功能。\n\n我需要先看看目前有什么页面，然后再看看是否能切换到其他阶段来完成这些操作。\n\n当前可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n其中 MANAGE_PAGES 看起来是管理页面的阶段，应该可以创建页面和设置属性。\n\n但当前阶段的可用工具只有 list_pages 和 list_points，无法创建页面或修改属性。\n\n所以我可以先调用 list_pages 看看当前有什么页面，然后切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段来创建页面。\n\n不过，让我先调用 list_pages 看看情况。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2203, "output_tokens": 158, "latency_ms": 2332.0254999998724, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，目前项目还没有任何页面。当前处于 **CONFIG_ALARM** 阶段，但创建页面不属于报警配置范畴，我需要切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段来处理页面相关操作。\n\n**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**", "reasoning": "用户想要创建页面，但目前处于 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，可用工具只有 `manage_alarms` 和 `manage_points`（仅限 list_points）。这些都不支持创建页面。\n\n我需要切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段来处理页面创建的需求。\n\n当前可切换的下一阶段是：BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n所以我可以建议切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2283, "output_tokens": 466, "latency_ms": 6463.897100000395, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "抱歉，当前阶段可用的工具（`manage_alarms`、`manage_points`）均不具备创建或修改页面布局的功能。我建议切换到 **GENERATE_LAYOUT** 阶段，该阶段通常用于处理页面布局与设计工作，包括创建页面、设置背景色、调整尺寸等。\n\n**next_state: GENERATE_LAYOUT**", "reasoning": "现在我在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段了，但是看看当前可用工具：\n\nmanage_alarms 和 manage_points 只有 list_points 和 alarm 相关的操作，没有创建页面的工具。\n\n等等，我的可用工具列表中只有 manage_alarms 和 manage_points，没有 manage_pages 工具。但实际上用户想创建页面，而当前阶段的可用工具看起来不太对。\n\n让我重新看看提示中的描述：\n\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- manage_alarms\n- manage_points\n\n这些是当前阶段可用的工具。但没有 manage_pages 工具可用。\n\n但用户的需求是创建页面，而当前阶段是 MANAGE_PAGES，但可用工具中并没有与页面管理相关的工具（比如 create_page 之类的）。\n\n也许我需要切换到其他阶段来完成这个任务？可切换的下一阶段包括：BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, VALIDATE\n\nGENERATE_LAYOUT 看起来可能和布局/页面设计有关？\n\n不过看描述，MANAGE_PAGES 阶段应该是用来管理页面的，但可用工具没有提供创建页面的功能。可能这些工具就是当前能用的全部了。\n\n让我重新审视一下 - 实际上，工具列表是全局的工具，并不是每个阶段有不同的工具。当前阶段是 MANAGE_PAGES，可用的工具是 manage_alarms 和 manage_points。\n\n这些工具都不支持创建页面。所以可能需要切换到 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段？\n\n或者，也许这些页面创建需要我通过文本交互来完成？但行为准则说必须从可用工具列表中选择。\n\n嗯，让我看看 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段 - 这可能与布局生成相关，也许能创建页面。\n\n我看还是先向用户说明目前可用工具无法创建页面，建议切换到 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2365, "output_tokens": 371, "latency_ms": 5229.409000001397, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "您看，当前 **GENERATE_LAYOUT** 阶段可用的工具仍然是 `manage_alarms` 和 `manage_points`，这两个工具都只能管理报警和点位，**不具备创建页面、设置背景色或调整页面尺寸的功能**。\n\n我尝试切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段看看是否具备相应的页面管理能力。\n\n**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**", "reasoning": "让我看看当前可用的工具：\n- manage_alarms: 创建/更新/启用/禁用/删除报警\n- manage_points: 创建/更新/删除/列出点位\n\n这些工具仍然是报警和点位相关的，没有页面创建工具。所以当前阶段 GENERATE_LAYOUT 的可用工具也不支持创建页面。\n\n让我重新思考一下。用户的需求是：\n1. 创建两个页面：\"报警汇总\" 和 \"报表\"\n2. 两个页面都用黑底\n3. 报表页大小设为4K\n\n当前可用工具中没有一个能创建页面或设置页面属性的。\n\n再看看可切换的下一阶段：BIND_POINTS, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nMANAGE_PAGES 阶段我刚刚切换过来过，但当时说没有可用工具。不过让我再仔细看看，当时 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段的可用工具是 manage_pages 允许 actions: list_pages。现在 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段同样没有直接创建页面的工具。\n\n实际上，这些工具都不支持创建页面。我需要向用户说明当前工具能力有限，无法完成页面创建的需求。\n\n或者再切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段看看？之前 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段只提供了 list_pages 动作，但现在再切换过去可能也是同样的工具列表。\n\n让我直接告诉用户目前可用工具无法满足创建页面的需求。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2485, "output_tokens": 640, "latency_ms": 8268.619800001034, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "抱歉，目前系统可用的工具范围仅限于 **manage_alarms（报警管理）** 和 **manage_points（点位管理）**，这些工具不具备以下能力：\n\n1. **创建页面**（如\"报警汇总\"、\"报表\"）\n2. **设置页面背景色**（如黑底）\n3. **调整页面尺寸**（如4K分辨率）\n\n您提到的工作流虽然可以切换到多个阶段（如 `BIND_POINTS`、`CONFIG_ALARM`、`CONFIG_HISTORY`、`CONFIG_SCRIPT`、`DEPLOY`、`VALIDATE`、`GENERATE_LAYOUT`），但所有阶段可调用的工具都仅限于 `manage_alarms` 和 `manage_points`，无法完成页面创建与布局设计的需求。\n\n**建议：**\n- 如果您希望在现有框架内完成配置，我可以帮您：\n  - 先创建 **报警汇总** 所需的报警点位与报警规则（通过 `manage_alarms` 和 `manage_points`）\n  - 后续页面布局和样式工作可能需要通过其他系统或人工完成\n- 您是否先让我继续完成报警和点位配置，页面布局部分留待后续处理？", "reasoning": "Again, the tools available are manage_alarms and manage_points. Neither of these can create pages, set background colors, or set page sizes.\n\nLet me think about this. The available tools across the board seem to be limited to manage_alarms and manage_points. These tools don't support creating pages or layouts.\n\nHowever, looking at the instructions more carefully:\n\n\"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nThe available next stages are: BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, VALIDATE\n\nNone of these seem to have page creation capabilities either based on the tools provided.\n\nActually, let me re-read the system prompt. It says:\n\n\"你是一个工业 SCADA 配置助手。根据用户的自然语言需求,调用以下工具完成 SCADA 项目配置。\"\n\nAnd the available tools across all stages seem to be only manage_alarms and manage_points. But the system says these are the \"当前可用工具\" for this phase.\n\nSince I don't have tools to create pages, set background colors, or set page sizes, I should honestly tell the user that the currently available tools don't support these operations, and I cannot proceed with their request.\n\nBut wait - maybe I'm overthinking this. Let me look at what manage_pages could do - but manage_pages isn't listed as a tool. Only manage_alarms and manage_points are available tools throughout all phases.\n\nI think I need to be transparent with the user that the available toolset (manage_alarms, manage_points) doesn't include functionality to create/manage pages, set backgrounds, or resize pages. I cannot fulfill this request with the current tools."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2756, "output_tokens": 383, "latency_ms": 5535.426700000244, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "明白了，现在回到 **CONFIG_ALARM（报警配置）** 阶段。当前我拥有的能力是配置报警和查询点位。\n\n虽然无法创建页面布局（\"报警汇总\"页和\"报表\"页的黑底、4K尺寸等），但我可以协助您完成报警配置部分的工作。例如：\n\n1. **先查看现有点位**，确认有哪些可用的标签（tags）\n2. **根据需要创建报警**（数字量报警或模拟量报警）\n\n请问您希望在\"报警汇总\"页上展示哪些报警？比如：\n- 需要创建哪些点位对应的报警？\n- 是数字量报警（如设备启停报警）还是模拟量报警（如温度/压力高限报警）？\n\n或者您有其他报警相关的配置需求？", "reasoning": "The user seems to be going back and forth between stages but hasn't clearly stated what they want to do now. Let me re-read the conversation.\n\nThe user originally wanted to:\n1. Create two pages: \"报警汇总\" (Alarm Summary) and \"报表\" (Report)\n2. Set black background for both\n3. Set the report page size to 4K\n\nBut the available tools in this system don't support page creation/management. The only available tools are `manage_alarms` and `manage_points`.\n\nSince we're now back in CONFIG_ALARM stage, and the user hasn't given me a new specific task related to alarms, I should ask them what they'd like to do with the available tools.\n\nActually, since they originally wanted an \"报警汇总\" (Alarm Summary) page, perhaps I can at least help set up the alarms that would appear on such a page. And maybe they want to proceed with alarm configuration now.\n\nLet me ask the user what they'd like to configure in the alarm system, since page creation is not possible with current tools."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 13080, "output_tokens": 2325, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 31694.99590000123}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "2259c62e-176c-4178-a5f0-048d40658872", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-013", "text": "建两个页面，一个叫报警汇总，一个叫报表，都用黑底，顺便把报表页大小设成4K", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:03.963Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:29.104Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:03.963Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:07.857Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:07.857Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:10.299Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:10.299Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:21.313Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:21.313Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:29.104Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6436000003304798, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 308, "latency_ms": 3891.797199999928, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查看一下当前已有的页面情况。", "reasoning": "用户想创建两个页面，一个叫\"报警汇总\"，一个叫\"报表\"，都用黑底，并且报表页大小设成4K。\n\n但当前可用的工具只有 `manage_pages`，而其当前允许的 actions 只有 `list_pages`。也就是说，我目前无法创建或修改页面，只能列出页面。\n\n我需要先看看当前有什么页面，然后看看是否有创建页面的能力。\n\n不过当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段包括 MANAGE_PAGES。所以我可以先调用 list_pages 看看当前页面情况，然后考虑切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段来创建页面。\n\n等等，让我再看一下 manage_pages 的参数定义。它只有一个 action: list_pages。没有 create_page 或 update_page 的操作。\n\n所以当前工具中，manage_pages 只支持 list_pages，不支持创建页面。而 manage_points 是管理点位的，不相关。\n\n那么我需要切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。但 MANAGE_PAGES 在【可切换的下一阶段】列表中，所以我可以回复中提示 next_state: MANAGE_PAGES。\n\n不过先让我看看当前有哪些页面，给用户一些上下文。\n\n让我先 list_pages 看看。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2204, "output_tokens": 161, "latency_ms": 2438.2798000006005, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前处于 **CONFIG_ALARM（报警配置）** 阶段，但您的需求是**创建页面（报警汇总和报表）**，这属于页面管理范畴，当前工具不支持创建页面操作。\n\n我将切换到页面管理阶段来处理您的需求。\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，可用工具只有 manage_alarms 和 manage_points。但是用户的请求是创建两个页面（报警汇总和报表），这需要使用页面管理相关的工具。当前阶段没有创建页面的工具。\n\n不过，在【可切换的下一阶段】中，有 MANAGE_PAGES 选项。我需要切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段来创建页面。\n\n所以我的回复应该包含 \"next_state: MANAGE_PAGES\" 来切换到适当的阶段。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2292, "output_tokens": 826, "latency_ms": 11010.966699999699, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前处于 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段，但遗憾的是，当前可用的工具列表中只包含了以下两个工具：\n\n1. **manage_alarms** — 管理报警（创建/启用/禁用/删除报警等）\n2. **manage_points** — 管理点位（仅支持列出点位）\n\n**没有提供用于创建/管理页面的工具（如 create_page、update_page 等）**，因此我暂时无法直接执行创建\"报警汇总\"和\"报表\"页面的操作。\n\n---\n\n不过，我可以将当前情况告知您，并看看是否有其他方式推进。可选方案如下：\n\n1. **切换到 DEPLOY 或 DONE 阶段** — 但这样也无法创建页面。\n2. **切换到 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段** — 可能能生成布局，但不确定是否有页面创建能力。\n3. **您能否通过平台手动创建这两个页面？** 或者，您可以提供更多工具接口信息/API，我再来协助配置。\n\n请问您希望如何处理？是否需要我尝试切换到其他阶段看看有没有可用的页面管理功能？", "reasoning": "好的，现在我在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。我需要看看当前可用的工具有哪些。\n\n不过当前可用的工具列表还是之前那些：manage_alarms 和 manage_points。但 manage_pages 应该可用。\n\n等等，我重新看系统提示。系统提示中给出的【当前可用工具】是：\n- manage_alarms\n- manage_points\n\n没有 manage_pages 工具。但是阶段是 MANAGE_PAGES。\n\n这有点矛盾。不过系统提示说\"你是一个工业 SCADA 配置助手。根据用户的自然语言需求,调用以下工具完成 SCADA 项目配置。\"\n\n当前的可用工具列表只列出了 manage_alarms 和 manage_points。没有 manage_pages 工具。\n\n但阶段是 MANAGE_PAGES，或许 manage_pages 工具应该是可用的，但函数定义中没有给出。\n\n让我再看看用户的需求：建两个页面，一个叫\"报警汇总\"，一个叫\"报表\"，都用黑底，报表页大小设成4K。\n\n当前可用工具中没有创建页面的工具。我需要告诉用户我无法完成这个需求，或者看看能不能切换到其他阶段。\n\n让我再看看可切换的下一阶段：BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, VALIDATE\n\n没有其他创建页面的阶段了。\n\n可能是我需要先 list_pages 看看有什么工具可用？但 list_pages 是 manage_pages 工具，而 manage_pages 不在可用工具列表中。\n\n嗯，这有点棘手。让我再看看系统提示...\n\n\"【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- manage_alarms: Create / update / enable / disable / delete SCADA alarms.; 当前允许 actions: disable_alarm, enable_alarm, delete_alarm, create_digital_alarm, create_analog_alarm, set_threshold\n- manage_points: Create / update / delete / list SCADA points (tags).; 当前允许 actions: list_points\"\n\n所以可用的工具只有这两个，没有 manage_pages。\n\n那在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段却没有 manage_pages 工具可用，这不太合理。可能是我需要提示切换到其他阶段。\n\n但用户的需求是创建页面，这应该是 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段的工作。既然没有工具可用，我可能需要告诉用户目前无法完成这个操作。\n\n或者，也许 manage_pages 工具应该自动可用但被遗漏了？不，我不能编造工具。\n\n让我检查 manage_points - 它的 actions 只有 list_points，所以也不能创建页面。\n\n看来当前阶段 MANAGE_PAGES 没有提供创建页面的工具。我可能需要告知用户当前限制，并看看是否有其他方式。\n\n或者，我可以看看是否可以从系统中获得 manage_pages 工具。但系统提示明确列出了可用工具，我不能自己添加。\n\n让我诚实地告诉用户，当前可用的工具不支持创建页面，并建议下一步该怎么做。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2530, "output_tokens": 463, "latency_ms": 7787.571300001218, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "很抱歉，当前可用的工具（**manage_alarms** 和 **manage_points**）仅支持报警管理和点位管理，**不支持创建或管理页面**的操作。\n\n目前的情况是：\n\n- 您想要创建 **\"报警汇总\"** 和 **\"报表\"** 两个页面，设置黑底，报表页大小为 4K\n- 但当前可用工具集中没有提供创建页面的功能（如 `create_page`、`update_page` 等）\n\n**建议您：**\n1. 通过 SCADA 平台的管理界面手动创建这两个页面（创建页面、设置背景色、调整大小）\n2. 或者，如果您有其他 API/工具可以提供给系统，请告知，我会继续协助配置\n3. 如果已有页面创建完成，我可以后续为您配置：\n   - ✅ **报警汇总页** → 关联报警配置（在 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段）\n   - ✅ **点位绑定** → 绑定点位到页面（在 BIND_POINTS 阶段）\n   - 等其他配置工作\n\n请问您希望怎么推进？", "reasoning": "用户又回到了 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段。看起来系统只提供了这几个工具，而创建页面的功能实际上并不在可用工具中。MANAGE_PAGES 阶段也没有提供创建页面的工具。\n\n既然系统让我在 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段继续，但用户的需求是创建页面，这个需求在当前阶段和当前可用工具下无法完成。我应该如实告知用户当前的情况。\n\n不过，也许我应该换个思路。既然无法创建页面，但也许我可以在报警配置阶段先做能做的工作，比如查看有哪些点位，为后续报警配置做准备？\n\n或者，用户的需求真的无法在当前工具集下实现。我应该坦诚告知用户，当前可用工具不支持创建页面，建议用户通过其他方式（如平台管理界面手动操作）来创建页面。\n\n等等，让我重新审视一下。用户说\"建两个页面\"，但可能他以为我现在能做这个。实际上当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，工具只有 manage_alarms 和 manage_points，确实不支持页面创建。\n\n我还是直接告诉用户，当前可用的工具无法支持创建页面操作，建议通过平台手动创建，或者如果有其他工具可以引入的话再告诉我。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8014, "output_tokens": 1758, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 25140.9507999997}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "68c55a83-8bcc-4e63-904a-7a4cf5dcad12", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-014", "text": "加三个IO点: TI-201, PI-201, FI-201, 全是AI，带历史", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "point"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:06.329Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:29.147Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:06.329Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:11.176Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:11.176Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:29.147Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5694999999832362, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.4728999992948957, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 989, "output_tokens": 400, "latency_ms": 4845.069000000876, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我先查看当前已有的点位和历史配置情况，以便做出适当决策。", "reasoning": "用户想添加三个IO点（TI-201, PI-201, FI-201），类型是AI（模拟量输入），并且需要带历史记录。\n\n但当前阶段是 `ANALYZE_INTENT`，当前可用的工具只有 `manage_history`（动作仅允许list_history）和 `manage_points`（动作仅允许list_points）。也就是说，目前只允许查询操作，不允许创建点或配置历史。\n\n所以，我无法直接创建点或配置历史。我需要先看看当前配置中是否已经存在这些点，或者看看系统状态。\n\n等等，让我重新看看。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，但工具列表有限制。实际上，在 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，我可能应该先分析用户意图，然后切换到合适的阶段来执行。\n\n用户的需求是：\n1. 添加三个IO点：TI-201, PI-201, FI-201（AI类型）\n2. 带历史记录\n\n从可切换的下一阶段来看，有 CONFIG_POINT（配置点）、CONFIG_HISTORY（配置历史）等。\n\n所以我应该先分析意图，然后告诉用户我要进入 CONFIG_POINT 阶段来添加点，再进入 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段来配置历史。\n\n但是，在切换阶段之前，我或许可以先查询一下当前已有的点，看看这些点是否已经存在。\n\n让我先查询一下当前的点列表和历史配置。\n\n好的，我先调用 list_points 和 list_history 来看看当前状态。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 1429, "output_tokens": 1327, "latency_ms": 17969.670500000575, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "明白您的需求，但当前阶段是 **CONFIG_HISTORY**，该阶段只能管理历史记录（查询/列出），**无法添加新的IO点位**。\n\n从当前可用的工具来看：\n- `manage_history` 仅支持 `list_history`（列出历史）和 `query_history`（查询历史数据）\n- 没有添加/创建点位的工具\n\n---\n\n**目前的情况：**\n- `list_points` 返回空 → **系统中尚无任何点位**\n- `list_history` 返回空 → **尚无历史配置**\n\n**需要先添加3个AI点（TI-201、PI-201、FI-201），再配置历史记录。**\n\n但当前阶段的可用工具无法创建点位。当前可切换的下一阶段为：`CONFIG_ALARM`, `CONFIG_SCRIPT`, `DEPLOY`, `DONE`, `VALIDATE`，其中没有 `CONFIG_POINT` 阶段。\n\n请问您是否能先通过系统其他方式（或在之前的阶段）创建好这三个AI点？或者您希望我直接切换到 **DONE** 先结束当前任务，再通过新的流程从头开始（包含点位添加阶段）？", "reasoning": "好的，当前阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，可用工具只有 manage_history，且允许的动作是 list_history 和 query_history。\n\n但用户的需求是：\n1. 添加三个IO点：TI-201, PI-201, FI-201（AI类型）\n2. 带历史记录\n\n在当前 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，我只能管理历史配置（list_history, query_history），无法添加新的IO点。添加IO点需要使用 CONFIG_POINT 阶段。\n\n所以我需要先告知用户，添加点位需要进入 CONFIG_POINT 阶段，然后再进入 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段来配置历史。\n\n让我想想流程：\n1. 先切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段来添加三个点\n2. 然后再切换到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段来配置历史\n\n但当前的阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，可切换的下一阶段是：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE\n\n没有 CONFIG_POINT 在可切换的下一阶段中。不过，我是不是应该先切换到一个可以添加点的阶段？\n\n等等，让我重新看看。用户说\"加三个IO点\"，但当前阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，可用工具只有 manage_history。而可切换的下一阶段中并没有 CONFIG_POINT。\n\n看起来我需要先切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段来添加点。但可切换的下一阶段中没有 CONFIG_POINT。\n\n等等，再看一下系统消息。可切换的下一阶段是：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE\n\n确实没有 CONFIG_POINT。这可能意味着点已经存在了，或者我需要通过其他方式。\n\n但问题是，当前是 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，用户要求添加点，但我没有添加点的工具。我只能在回复中建议切换到其他阶段。\n\n不过，用户说\"加三个IO点\" + \"带历史\"，而当前是 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，也许我应该先说明情况：添加点位需要先切换到合适的阶段。\n\n让我想想是否可以在 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段做点什么。工具只有 list_history 和 query_history，没有添加历史记录的选项。\n\n哦等等，manage_history 的 actions 只有 list_history 和 query_history，没有 add 或 create 之类的。\n\n所以，在 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，我无法添加新的历史记录配置，也无法添加新的点。\n\n因此，我应该告知用户，添加IO点需要先进入 CONFIG_POINT 阶段，或者需要切换到其他合适的阶段。\n\n但可切换的下一阶段中没有 CONFIG_POINT。这有点奇怪。\n\n也许系统认为 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段已经包含了对历史的管理，但工具只允许查询。\n\n实际上，我觉得用户的需求分两步：\n1. 添加三个AI点（需要在 CONFIG_POINT 阶段完成）\n2. 给这些点配置历史记录（在 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段完成）\n\n由于当前阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，而可切换的阶段中没有 CONFIG_POINT，这可能意味着这些点已经存在了，或者我需要在当前阶段先看看能不能处理。\n\n不过实际上，更合理的做法是：我先告诉用户，添加IO点不在当前 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段的能力范围内，建议切换到合适的阶段先添加点位，然后再回来配置历史。\n\n但可切换的下一阶段是：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE\n\n这些阶段都没有提供添加点的能力。\n\n也许系统设计的流程是：点已经提前配置好了，我现在只需要在 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段为它们配置历史记录？\n\n可是 list_points 和 list_history 都返回空，说明目前没有任何点。\n\n那我该怎么办？\n\n也许我可以这样处理：用户要求\"加三个IO点并带历史\"，但当前阶段可用的工具无法添加点。我需要在回复中说明情况，并尝试切换到合适的阶段（虽然列表中没有 CONFIG_POINT）。\n\n或者，可能 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段就是负责配置历史的，而添加点是更早的阶段完成的。所以当前我无法添加点。\n\n让我换一种思路：我告诉用户，当前处于 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，只能管理历史配置，无法添加新的IO点。请先进入合适的阶段（如 CONFIG_POINT）添加点位，然后再回到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段配置历史记录。\n\n但可切换的下一阶段中没有 CONFIG_POINT...\n\n好吧，也许我只能利用可切换的阶段先切换到 VALIDATE 或 DONE，但这显然不合理。\n\n我觉得最好的方式是向用户说明当前阶段的能力限制，请求用户指示是否可以先切换到其他阶段，或者让系统进入 CONFIG_POINT 阶段。\n\n但实际上，看系统的设计，可能这些阶段已经设定好了，我只需要按照流程来。\n\n我的建议：先向用户说明，添加IO点需要在 CONFIG_POINT 阶段完成，当前 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段只能管理历史记录，无法添加新点。请先切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段（如果可用）来添加点，或者请用户确认是否系统已在其他阶段完成了点位的添加。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2418, "output_tokens": 1727, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22818.775100000494}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "46f282d0-7021-4ea4-af31-3184ceecdd1a", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-015", "text": "给TI-201 set一个HH alarm和LL alarm，分别在100和10，priority设为high", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:29.373Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:42.733Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:29.373Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:31.304Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:31.304Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:42.733Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:42.733Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:42.733Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5841000001964858, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "TI-201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "high_limit": 100, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "TI-201_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.TI-201_HH": {"id": "TI-201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 100.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.6461000011768192, "intended_entities": ["alarms.TI-201_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "TI-201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "low_limit": 10, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "TI-201_LL"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.TI-201_LL": {"id": "TI-201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": 10.0, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.4633999997167848, "intended_entities": ["alarms.TI-201_LL"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:05c6700f988adc139d71feadae75a478d9bf1bae1cafb24aa10c723956d1196d", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 982, "output_tokens": 144, "latency_ms": 1929.1061000003538, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查看当前系统中已有的点位，确认 TI-201 是否存在。", "reasoning": "用户想给TI-201设置HH报警和LL报警，阈值分别是100和10，优先级为high。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段包括 CONFIG_ALARM。但当前可用的工具有 manage_pages 和 manage_points。我先看看当前有哪些点位，看看TI-201是否存在。\n\n让我先列出所有点位，看看TI-201是否已经存在。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2069, "output_tokens": 775, "latency_ms": 8678.630300000805, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，TI-201 已经存在且为模拟量类型。现在我为它创建两个独立的模拟量报警：一个高高报警（HH，阈值100）和一个低低报警（LL，阈值10），优先级都设为 high。", "reasoning": "TI-201 已存在，是一个模拟量点位（analog type）。现在我需要为它创建两个模拟量报警：\n\n1. HH报警（高高报警）：high_limit = 100，优先级 high\n2. LL报警（低低报警）：low_limit = 10，优先级 high\n\n我可以使用 `manage_alarms` 工具的 `create_analog_alarm` 动作来创建。不过一个模拟量报警只能有 high_limit 和 low_limit 一起设置。通常 HH 和 LL 是分开的报警，但既然工具允许同时设置 high_limit 和 low_limit，我可能需要考虑一下。\n\n不过根据用户的需求，他明确说了 \"HH alarm\" 和 \"LL alarm\"，这是两个独立的报警。但 `create_analog_alarm` 一次调用可以同时设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。\n\n但 HH 和 LL 在 SCADA 中通常是不同的报警级别。HH（高高）是比高报警更高的级别，LL（低低）是比低报警更低的级别。\n\n看工具的说明：`create_analog_alarm` 创建的是 \"an analog alarm with high/low limits\"。所以一次创建可以同时设置 high 和 low 限制。\n\n但用户想要两个独立的报警：一个 HH（高高报警，阈值100），一个 LL（低低报警，阈值10），并且优先级都是 high。\n\n我可以用一次 `create_analog_alarm` 调用来创建吗？但这样就是一个报警同时有 high 和 low limit。或者我可以创建两个独立的报警？\n\n看工具的参数，`id` 是唯一的报警 ID。我可以创建两个不同的报警：\n1. 报警ID: \"TI-201_HH\" - high_limit=100, 无 low_limit\n2. 报警ID: \"TI-201_LL\" - low_limit=10, 无 high_limit\n\n但工具参数中 high_limit 和 low_limit 都是可选（nullable），可以只设置其中一个。\n\n不过，通常 HH 和 LL 是独立的报警实体。让我创建两个独立的报警。\n\n等等，实际上对于模拟量报警，\"HH\" 和 \"LL\" 通常是通过不同的报警ID来区分的。我会创建两个独立的报警。\n\n第一个：TI-201_HH，high_limit=100，priority=high\n第二个：TI-201_LL，low_limit=10，priority=high\n\n这两个调用没有依赖关系，可以同时进行。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4253, "output_tokens": 171, "latency_ms": 2741.014699999141, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警均已成功创建！以下是配置总结：\n\n| 报警ID | 点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|--------|------|------|------|--------|\n| **TI-201_HH** | TI-201 | 高高报警 (HH) | 高限 = **100** | **high** |\n| **TI-201_LL** | TI-201 | 低低报警 (LL) | 低限 = **10** | **high** |\n\nTI-201 的 HH 和 LL 报警已配置完毕，如果还有其他需求请继续告诉我。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "两个报警都创建成功了。现在用户还想要什么吗？他最初的需求就是给TI-201设置HH和LL报警。\n\n既然已经完成了，我应该告诉用户并可以结束任务了。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7304, "output_tokens": 1090, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 13359.891100000823}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "6daf988c-9681-4dc0-be19-a3a5c7a83841", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-014", "text": "加三个IO点: TI-201, PI-201, FI-201, 全是AI，带历史", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "point"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:29.363Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:43.107Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:29.363Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:34.099Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:34.099Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:43.107Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5910999989282573, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5918000006204238, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 989, "output_tokens": 381, "latency_ms": 4734.548599999471, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，让我先查看一下现有的点位和历史配置情况。", "reasoning": "用户想要添加三个IO点（TI-201, PI-201, FI-201），类型都是AI（模拟量输入），并且要带历史记录（即需要配置历史记录）。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具是 manage_history 和 manage_points，允许的 actions 只有 list_history 和 list_points。\n\n我需要先看看现有的点位和历史配置情况。不过，要添加点，我需要的工具是 manage_points 的创建操作，但当前允许的 actions 只有 list_points 和 list_history，没有 create 操作。\n\n让我先查一下现有的点位和历史配置。\n\n等等，我再仔细看：\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT\n可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n当前阶段 ANALYZE_INTENT 的可用工具只有 manage_points (list_points) 和 manage_history (list_history) - 都是查询类的。\n\n所以在这个阶段，我只能查询，不能创建。要创建点，我可能需要切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段，要配置历史，需要切换到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段。\n\n但首先，让我先查询一下现有的点位信息，看看有没有重复或冲突。\n\n让我先 list_points 看看。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 1410, "output_tokens": 718, "latency_ms": 9005.33870000072, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前我处于 **CONFIG_HISTORY**（历史配置）阶段，只能对已有点位进行历史配置管理。但是根据刚才的查询，系统中还没有任何点位（当前点位列表为空）。\n\n您的需求是：\n1. **添加三个AI点位**：TI-201、PI-201、FI-201\n2. **带历史记录**（为它们启用历史归档）\n\n这两个步骤需要分阶段完成：\n1. **先创建点位** → 需要切换到能创建点位（CONFIG_POINT）的阶段\n2. **再配置历史** → 在当前 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段完成\n\n但是当前 **CONFIG_HISTORY** 阶段可切换的下一阶段为：`CONFIG_ALARM`、`CONFIG_SCRIPT`、`DEPLOY`、`DONE`、`VALIDATE`，其中**没有 CONFIG_POINT** 可切换。\n\n请问您希望我如何处理？比如：\n- 是否先切换到 `VALIDATE` 或 `DONE` 再重新开始流程来建点？\n- 或者您是否有其他方式先将这三个点位添加到系统中？", "reasoning": "好的，现在我的阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，可切换的下一阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。\n\n当前可用工具只有 manage_history，允许的 actions 是 list_history 和 query_history。\n\n但是用户的需求是\"加三个IO点: TI-201, PI-201, FI-201, 全是AI，带历史\"。\n\n首先，要添加IO点（点位），我需要创建点位。目前我处于 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，只能管理历史配置，不能创建点位。要创建点位，我需要先切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段... 但 CONFIG_POINT 不在可切换的下一阶段列表中。\n\n等等，让我重新审视一下。\n\n当前阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，可切换的下一阶段是：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。\n\n这里没有 CONFIG_POINT 阶段可以切换。但我现在只能做历史相关的操作。\n\n不过等等，用户是说\"带历史\"，意味着这些点位需要配置历史记录。但点位本身还没有创建。\n\n也许我应该先告诉用户，我当前处于 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，只能管理历史配置，无法创建新的点位。我需要先切换到能创建点位的阶段。\n\n但是可切换的下一阶段列表中没有 CONFIG_POINT 或类似的阶段...\n\n让我重新看看整个阶段列表。系统提示中的【当前阶段】是 CONFIG_HISTORY，【可切换的下一阶段】是 CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。\n\n看起来这里缺少了 CONFIG_POINT 这个阶段选项。我应该先向用户说明情况，看看用户想怎么处理。\n\n或者，也许系统之前有别的阶段配置，现在我直接进入了 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，可能点位已经在之前的阶段创建好了？但 list_points 显示为空，所以点位还没有创建。\n\n我应该向用户反馈当前的情况：我处于 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，只能做历史配置，但点位尚未创建。需要先创建点位才能配置历史。\n\n不过，让我再想想 - 或许我应该尝试切换到 VALIDATE 或别的阶段？不，这没有意义。\n\n最佳做法是向用户说明情况并询问。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2399, "output_tokens": 1099, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 13744.298300000082}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "7d6abf6d-b51c-420f-9bb9-d154b8e8110d", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-014", "text": "加三个IO点: TI-201, PI-201, FI-201, 全是AI，带历史", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "point"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:28.308Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:44.006Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:28.308Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:32.645Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:32.645Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:44.006Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:44.006Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:44.006Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6071999996493105, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.47140000060608145, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 989, "output_tokens": 346, "latency_ms": 4334.4405999996525, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查一下当前已有的点位和历史配置情况。", "reasoning": "用户想加三个IO点：TI-201, PI-201, FI-201，都是AI（模拟量输入），并且带历史记录。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段包括 BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_HISTORY 等。\n\n让我先看看当前已有的点和历史配置情况。先查询现有点位和历史配置。\n\n当前可用工具有：\n1. manage_history - 当前允许 actions: list_history\n2. manage_points - 当前允许 actions: list_points\n\n我需要先查一下现有的点，看看是否已经存在这些点，以及历史配置情况。\n\n但工具目前只有 list_points 和 list_history。要创建点（CONFIG_POINT）和配置历史（CONFIG_HISTORY），可能需要切换到其他阶段。\n\n不过根据规则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以切换阶段。\n\n让我先查询现有点位和历史记录，了解一下现状。\n\n等等，工具中 manage_points 和 manage_history 只提供了 list 操作。要创建点，我需要进入 CONFIG_POINT 阶段；要配置历史，需要进入 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段。\n\n不过让我先查询一下现有的点位，看看这些点是否已经存在。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 1375, "output_tokens": 895, "latency_ms": 11359.657500001049, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前您处于 **CONFIG_HISTORY** 阶段，可用工具为 `manage_history`，但仅支持以下操作：\n- `list_history` — 查看已有的历史配置\n- `query_history` — 查询某标签的历史数据窗口\n\n而您需要的 **添加三个 IO 点（TI-201、PI-201、FI-201）** 属于点位创建操作，需要切换到 **CONFIG_POINT** 阶段才能完成；配置历史归档也需要相应的配置操作。\n\n但目前从 **CONFIG_HISTORY** 阶段，可切换的下一阶段只有：`CONFIG_ALARM`、`CONFIG_SCRIPT`、`DEPLOY`、`DONE`、`VALIDATE`，**没有 CONFIG_POINT**。\n\n因此，在当前阶段我无法完成\"添加三个新 IO 点并配置历史\"的操作。建议您：\n\n1. **先退出当前流程**（`next_state: DONE`），重新从起点开始，依次经过 **CONFIG_POINT**（添加点）→ **CONFIG_HISTORY**（配置历史）来完成需求。\n2. 或者，如果只是**查询已有历史数据**，我可以帮您用 `query_history` 来查看现有标签的趋势。\n\n请问您希望如何处理？", "reasoning": "用户当前在 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，可用工具只有 manage_history，且允许的 actions 是 list_history 和 query_history。但用户的需求是：\n1. 添加三个 IO 点：TI-201, PI-201, FI-201（都是 AI 点）\n2. 为它们配置历史记录\n\n当前阶段只能管理历史记录，不能创建点。所以我需要先切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段来创建点，然后再回到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段来配置历史。\n\n不过等等，让我看看可切换的下一阶段：\n当前阶段 CONFIG_HISTORY\n可切换的下一阶段：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE\n\nCONFIG_POINT 不在可切换列表中！所以从 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段无法直接切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段。\n\n那意味着我无法从当前阶段创建点。用户说\"加三个IO点\"，但当前阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，可切换的是 CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。\n\n嗯，看来工作流已经进入到了一个特定的阶段链中。让我重新思考一下。\n\n实际上，当前阶段是 CONFIG_HISTORY，而之前可能已经经过了一些阶段，比如 CONFIG_POINT 已经完成了？但前面查询显示没有任何点。\n\n看起来工作流已经设定了当前阶段和可切换的下一阶段。CONFIG_POINT 不在可切换列表中，所以我无法去创建点。\n\n不过，用户的需求是\"加三个IO点...带历史\"。当前我能做的是查询历史和管理历史。\n\n让我看看 history 工具是否有能力添加点？manage_history 的 actions 只有 list_history 和 query_history，无法添加历史配置。\n\n所以当前阶段无法满足用户需求。我需要告诉用户目前处于 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，只能查询或管理已有的历史记录，无法直接添加新的 IO 点及其历史配置。\n\n但我可以试着切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段？不对，CONFIG_POINT 不在可切换的下一阶段列表中。\n\n可切换的下一阶段：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE\n\n这些都不涉及创建点。\n\n也许我应该诚实告诉用户，当前处于 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，只能管理已有的历史数据（查询历史列表、查询历史窗口数据），无法执行创建点或配置历史归档的操作。如果用户确实需要加新点，可能需要重新审视工作流流程。\n\n不过让我再想想 - 也许我可以先切换到 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段？那也不对。\n\n或者，也许我理解错了，用户只是说\"带历史\"，意思是需要为这些点配置历史记录。但创建点本身是在之前的阶段完成的，而我现在只能查询现有的历史。\n\n我认为最合适的做法是向用户解释当前所处的阶段和可用能力，并说明无法在此阶段创建新点和配置历史，建议调整工作流。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2364, "output_tokens": 1241, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 15698.450099998809}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "a13a12f7-732c-48b1-8ab0-de8a1b90f472", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-015", "text": "给TI-201 set一个HH alarm和LL alarm，分别在100和10，priority设为high", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:43.040Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:55.330Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:43.040Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:45.810Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:45.810Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:55.330Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:55.330Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:55.330Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5743000001530163, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_TI201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "high_limit": 100, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_TI201_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_TI201_HH": {"id": "alarm_TI201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 100.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.6498999991890742, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI201_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_TI201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "low_limit": 10, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_TI201_LL"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_TI201_LL": {"id": "alarm_TI201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": 10.0, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.46830000064801425, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_TI201_LL"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:c2c6f084ec267c5d8f6b86c605eff94c847bd464cdc720e9489a9404a9fef9ca", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 982, "output_tokens": 223, "latency_ms": 2767.8878999995504, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查看一下当前的 SCADA 点位信息，确认 TI-201 是否存在以及它的类型。", "reasoning": "用户想给一个点（TI-201）设置高报警（HH alarm）和低报警（LL alarm）。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段包括 BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE 等。\n\n当前可用的工具有 manage_pages（只允许 list_pages）和 manage_points（只允许 list_points）。\n\n我目前的信息不足以直接配置报警，我需要先了解现有的点位情况。让我先查看已有的点位，看看 TI-201 是否存在。\n\n先调用 list_points 看看有没有 TI-201 这个点。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2148, "output_tokens": 520, "latency_ms": 5502.548000000388, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "TI-201 确实存在，是一个模拟量点（analog），适合创建模拟量报警。我现在为您创建两个独立的报警：\n\n1. **HH 报警** — high_limit = 100\n2. **LL 报警** — low_limit = 10\n\n两个优先级都设为 **high**。", "reasoning": "好的，TI-201 是一个模拟量点位（analog），类型匹配。用户想要：\n1. 一个 HH 报警（高高位报警），阈值为 100\n2. 一个 LL 报警（低低位报警），阈值为 10\n3. priority 设为 high\n\n对于模拟量报警，我应该使用 `create_analog_alarm` 来创建。但是一个报警只能有一个 high_limit 和一个 low_limit。用户要的是两个独立的报警（HH和LL），所以需要创建两个模拟量报警：\n\n1. 一个 alarm 用于 HH：high_limit=100，可以叫 \"alarm_TI201_HH\"\n2. 一个 alarm 用于 LL：low_limit=10，可以叫 \"alarm_TI201_LL\"\n\n两个都设 priority=high。\n\n等等，让我再想想。通常 HH 和 LL 是独立的报警。我可以创建两个独立的报警。\n\n让我创建两个报警。\n\n不过，我需要给它们唯一的 ID。我可以用 \"TI201_HH\" 和 \"TI201_LL\"。\n\n好的，开始创建。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4081, "output_tokens": 319, "latency_ms": 4008.1890000001295, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **报警配置完成！** 以下是已创建的报警摘要：\n\n| 报警 ID | 关联点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|--------|\n| `alarm_TI201_HH` | **TI-201** | **HH 报警**（高高位） | high_limit = **100** | 🔴 **high** |\n| `alarm_TI201_LL` | **TI-201** | **LL 报警**（低低位） | low_limit = **10** | 🔴 **high** |\n\n---\n\n当前您还可以继续处理以下事项（可切换阶段）：\n- **BIND_POINTS** — 绑定点位到 HMI 页面\n- **CONFIG_HISTORY** — 配置历史数据记录\n- **CONFIG_SCRIPT** — 配置脚本逻辑\n- **VALIDATE** — 校验整个项目\n- **DEPLOY** — 部署到目标环境\n\n请问您还有其他配置需求吗？如果已完成，我可以直接结束任务。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "两个报警都创建成功了。现在我要告知用户结果，并询问是否还有其他需求，或者是否可以结束任务。\n\n当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，可切换的下一阶段包括 BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。\n\n用户的需求已经完成，我可以告诉用户任务完成，并询问是否需要其他操作，或者直接结束。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7211, "output_tokens": 1062, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 12289.652000001297}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "45c86175-9304-43b9-977c-2490f46c56a5", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-015", "text": "给TI-201 set一个HH alarm和LL alarm，分别在100和10，priority设为high", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:43.253Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:55.624Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:43.253Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:45.304Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:45.304Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:55.624Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:55.624Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:39:55.624Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6071999996493105, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "TI-201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "high_limit": 100, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "TI-201_HH"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.TI-201_HH": {"id": "TI-201_HH", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 100.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.6771000007574912, "intended_entities": ["alarms.TI-201_HH"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "TI-201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "low_limit": 10, "priority": "high"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "TI-201_LL"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.TI-201_LL": {"id": "TI-201_LL", "tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "high_limit": null, "low_limit": 10.0, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "high", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.5209000009926967, "intended_entities": ["alarms.TI-201_LL"], "referenced_entities": ["points.TI-201"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5c36a73b4c1d2de1572720df5fcdfadf57212e64b3121822dbe294c91f962227", "final_hash": "sha256:05c6700f988adc139d71feadae75a478d9bf1bae1cafb24aa10c723956d1196d", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 982, "output_tokens": 134, "latency_ms": 2049.6498000011343, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来先查询一下当前系统中的点位信息，看看 TI-201 是否存在。", "reasoning": "用户想给一个叫\"TI-201\"的点配置报警（HH alarm和LL alarm），分别在100和10，优先级设为high。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具有 manage_pages 和 manage_points。\n\n首先，我需要了解一下现有系统中是否已经存在名为\"TI-201\"的点。让我先查询一下现有的点列表。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 2059, "output_tokens": 704, "latency_ms": 7182.991499999844, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！系统中已存在 **TI-201** 这个模拟量点位。现在我来为它创建两个独立的报警：\n\n1. **HH alarm**（高高位报警）：阈值 **100**，优先级 **high**\n2. **LL alarm**（低低位报警）：阈值 **10**，优先级 **high**\n\n两者没有依赖关系，可以同时创建。", "reasoning": "好的，系统里已经存在 TI-201 这个模拟量（analog）点位。现在用户想要：\n\n1. 一个 HH alarm（高高位报警）在 100，priority = high\n2. 一个 LL alarm（低低位报警）在 10，priority = high\n\n当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，可用工具有 manage_alarms（可创建模拟量报警）。\n\n对于模拟量报警，可以使用 `create_analog_alarm` 来创建带高限和低限的报警。\n\n但用户说的是 HH alarm 和 LL alarm，这通常是两个独立的报警（高高位和低低位）。但 create_analog_alarm 可以同时设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。不过HH和LL通常意味着两个不同的报警ID。\n\n让我想想，通常在一个模拟量报警中，可以设置 high_limit 作为高高报警，low_limit 作为低低报警。但用户说的是 \"一个HH alarm和一个LL alarm\"，可能想要创建两个独立的报警。\n\n不过从 create_analog_alarm 的参数来看，它允许同时设置 high_limit 和 low_limit。我可以创建一个 analog alarm，high_limit=100，low_limit=10，priority=high，这样就是一个同时有高高和低低报警的模拟量报警。\n\n但用户说\"一个HH alarm和LL alarm\"，这听起来像是两个独立的报警。不过 create_analog_alarm 一个报警可以同时包含高限和低限。让我用一个报警来覆盖两种情况，分别给它们不同的ID。\n\n或者，更合理的方式是创建两个独立的模拟量报警：\n1. 一个 HH alarm：tag=TI-201, high_limit=100, id=\"TI-201_HH\"\n2. 一个 LL alarm：tag=TI-201, low_limit=10, id=\"TI-201_LL\"\n\n这样更清晰，符合用户说的\"一个HH alarm和LL alarm\"。\n\n两个调用之间没有依赖关系，可以同时进行。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4172, "output_tokens": 231, "latency_ms": 3126.946300000782, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警都已成功创建！以下是配置总结：\n\n| 报警 ID | 点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 | 状态 |\n|---------|------|------|------|--------|------|\n| **TI-201_HH** | TI-201 | 高高报警 (HH) | 100 | 🔴 High | ✅ 已创建 |\n| **TI-201_LL** | TI-201 | 低低报警 (LL) | 10 | 🔴 High | ✅ 已创建 |\n\n当 **TI-201** 的值 **≥ 100** 时触发 **HH alarm**，当 **≤ 10** 时触发 **LL alarm**，均为高优先级报警。\n\n请问还需要配置其他报警吗？如果没有其他需求，可以结束本阶段任务。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "两个报警都创建成功了。现在用户的需求已经完成了。我应该总结一下结果，然后询问用户是否还需要其他操作，或者可以结束任务。\n\n由于当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，且任务已完成，我可以询问用户是否还需要其他配置，或者直接进入 DONE 状态。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7213, "output_tokens": 1069, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 12371.20369999866}, "judge": null}
