, "points.PumpA"]}, {"turn": 4, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "create_page", "bind_point"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["apply_flow_layout", "group_widgets", "create_rect", "delete_widget"]}, {"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_devices", "allowed_actions": ["create_device"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script"]}, {"name": "manage_schedules", "allowed_actions": ["create_schedule"]}], "visible_count": 7, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "bind_point", "args": {"action": "bind_point", "page_id": "pump_station", "widget_id": "pumpB_widget", "property": "value", "tag": "PumpB"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"binding": "pumpB_widget.value=PumpB"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"pages.pump_station.widgets.pumpB_widget.bindings.value": "PumpB"}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.5240000009507639, "intended_entities": ["pages.pump_station.widgets.pumpB_widget.bindings.value"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.pump_station", "pages.pump_station.widgets.pumpB_widget", "points.PumpB"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:98327752e448e2768a1d5554e14583a307747a19d68f8b9f81b75d5bd3482296", "final_hash": "sha256:2a2b8f787a890e1fc56d33b96ec45ef75b160451b4fe883c8501eab1fdb28db3", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 982, "output_tokens": 349, "latency_ms": 4191.162099999929, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我先查询一下系统中已有的点位和页面信息，看看 PumpA 和 PumpB 是否已存在，以及当前有哪些页面。", "reasoning": "当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，用户需要：\n1. 新建泵站画面\n2. 添加2个泵图元\n3. 分别绑定PumpA和PumpB点位\n\n让我先看看当前可用的工具，以及可切换的下一阶段有哪些。\n\n当前可用工具：\n- manage_points: 当前允许 actions: list_points\n- manage_pages: 当前允许 actions: list_pages\n\n当前工作流上下文：workflow=PointBinding, step=list_targets\n\n看起来我需要先列出已有的点位和页面，了解当前系统状态。\n\n不过，用户的需求涉及：\n1. 新建画面 - 这应该属于 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，但当前可用工具中 manage_pages 只允许 list_pages 操作\n2. 添加图元并绑定点位 - 这也需要额外的操作\n\n让我先查看当前已有的点位和页面信息，看看PumpA和PumpB是否存在。\n\n等等，当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，而且可切换的下一阶段包括 MANAGE_PAGES、BIND_POINTS 等。\n\n我想先列出已有的点信息和页面信息，这样我可以更好地提供建议。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4394, "output_tokens": 386, "latency_ms": 3906.039999999848, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！系统已有 **PumpA** 和 **PumpB** 两个数字点位，但还没有任何页面。现在我按照以下步骤来实施：\n\n1. **先创建泵站页面并添加泵图元** → 切换到 `MANAGE_PAGES` 阶段\n2. **再绑定点位** → 切换到 `BIND_POINTS` 阶段\n\n让我们先进入画面创建阶段。\n\n**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**\n\n我来创建泵站页面和两个泵图元：", "reasoning": "好的，现在系统中有：\n- PumpA - digital类型\n- PumpB - digital类型\n- 目前没有任何页面\n\n用户想要：\n1. 新建泵站画面\n2. 添加2个泵图元\n3. 分别绑定PumpA和PumpB点位\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，下一阶段可以切换。我需要按步骤来：\n\n1. 首先创建页面 - 需要切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段\n2. 创建泵图元 - 也在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段（create_widget）\n3. 绑定点位 - 需要切换到 BIND_POINTS 阶段\n\n所以让我先切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段来创建页面和图元。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 4800, "output_tokens": 305, "latency_ms": 2811.7594000013924, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面创建成功！现在添加两个泵图元：", "reasoning": "页面创建成功。现在在该页面上创建2个泵图元。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 5171, "output_tokens": 285, "latency_ms": 2485.0358000003325, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个泵图元已成功添加！现在切换到绑定点位阶段。\n\n**next_state: BIND_POINTS**", "reasoning": "两个泵图元创建成功。现在需要绑定PumpA和PumpB点位到这两个图元上。切换到 BIND_POINTS 阶段。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 5515, "output_tokens": 248, "latency_ms": 2822.714100000667, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "全部完成！以下是配置摘要：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 泵站画面配置完成\n\n### 📄 新建页面\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **页面ID** | `pump_station` |\n| **页面名称** | **泵站画面** |\n| **分辨率** | 1920 × 1080 |\n| **背景色** | `#F0F4F8` |\n\n### 🛠 泵图元及点位绑定\n| 图元ID | 类型 | 位置 | 绑定点位 | 类型 |\n|--------|------|------|----------|------|\n| `pumpA_widget` | 🌀 泵 | (100,200) | **PumpA** | digital |\n| `pumpB_widget` | 🌀 泵 | (350,200) | **PumpB** | digital |\n\n两个泵图元分别绑定了 `PumpA.value` 和 `PumpB.value` 属性，它们都是数字量点位，可直观显示泵的启停状态。\n\n**next_state: DONE**", "reasoning": "所有任务都成功完成了！我来总结一下完成的工作。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 20862, "output_tokens": 1573, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16245.086599999922}, "judge": null}
